{"version":1,"content":"<p>俄羅斯堪察加半島地區周五（16日）發生6.9級地震，日本氣象廳緊急通報該地震於日本時間中午12時40分（本港時間上午11時40分）發生，強度達9.9級，震央位於千島群島，引起民眾恐慌，8分鐘後該緊急通報被撤回。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:20:42.947491+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:56:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T10:17:34.596032+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:17:40.256493+00:00","content_hash":"78c468c1cfb20bbe32e459a44e9528b1f34561ee3e0997d584b548eef16533c7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}